            <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">What is the cheapest AccuWeb VPS plan?</h3>
            <p>The cheapest is VPS Edge at $4.95/month (promo): 1 dedicated vCPU, 4 GB RAM, 50 GB SSD, and 250 GB transfer on a 1 Gbps port. The lineup scales through VPS Peak ($6.95/mo, 2 vCPU / 8 GB / 100 GB), VPS Power ($9.95/mo, 3 vCPU / 16 GB / 200 GB), and VPS Supreme ($19.95/mo, 4 vCPU / 32 GB / 400 GB). Standard non-promo monthly rates are higher (Edge $18.99 and up).</p>
          </div>
