            <p>AccuWeb deploys VPS across 16+ verified locations: Denver, Hyderabad, New York, N. Virginia, Ohio, Oregon, Seoul, Singapore, Sydney, Tokyo, Montreal, Frankfurt, Ireland, London, Paris, Johannesburg, and Stockholm. Facilities are SOC 2 Type II certified and GDPR-ready.</p>
          </div>
