            <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">When was AccuWeb Hosting founded?</h3>
            <p>AccuWeb Hosting was founded in 2003 (copyright 2003-2026) with a 23+ year track record. It is part of the Vaghasia Group of Companies and reports servicing over 55,000 web hosting accounts.</p>
